{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1000_p", "source_sha256": "588edfc5e8a3a024fdf1d85d373bc93df6802d429111bfb7a386b9a9017da9af", "ja": "（気分転換に劇場を散歩していたら、\n美也がなにやら難しい顔をしていた……）", "zh": "（为了转换一下心情，我在剧场里散步时，发现美也似乎正一脸苦恼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "9f623f00cf77bda08575bb5dce3fd68d2e40c06b3c1608a11e94e0324335a664", "ja": "むーん……あっ、{$P$}さん～。\n丁度いいところに～。", "zh": "唔……啊，{$P$}先生～。\n你来得正好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1002_p", "source_sha256": "784c07d6d0b4445d988b49cb43adbaf47748993c1dc92dfea5260b0786dcf148", "ja": "お疲れ様、美也。\nん？　机の上にあるのは……卵と、絵の具？", "zh": "辛苦了，美也。\n嗯？桌上放着的是……鸡蛋和颜料？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "802fadd5e90f6f59b0dbea76103903dadb4c7eea788b99586effa0aabebe6926", "ja": "はい～。イースターエッグの用意をしてたんです～。\nでも、どう色を付けたらいいか悩んでまして……。", "zh": "是的～我正在准备复活节彩蛋～  \n可是，我正在苦恼该怎么上色才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "616461b7a845c9eef66c73bda5749ad2dbf30251f8460ca104aa8c08ce936f00", "ja": "色や模様はたくさん浮かぶんですけど、\nなぜか、どのデザインもしっくり来ないんです～。", "zh": "颜色和图案倒是冒出了很多，不过不知为什么，每一种设计都觉得不太对劲～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cb555f582c60948bb8bad4e234addcafb39e8d735fcd4843cb02c48c8a14c602", "ja": "それで悩んでたのか……。\nよし！　俺も一緒に手伝おう。", "zh": "原来你是在为这个烦恼啊……\n好！我也来一起帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "5f7c044eb53136e493840899c1806221c60433397627a223c4a3280443442230", "ja": "はい～。よろしくお願いします～。\n思いついたことがあったら、どんどん言ってください。", "zh": "好的～那就拜托您啦～  \n如果想到什么，就尽管说出来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1007_p", "source_sha256": "84eb073f6b97a39346b2c2c598505e30de3fbf51aa1b90c1e43ba1d0222065fe", "ja": "わかった。……そうだなあ。\n美也にとって、卵はどんなイメージだ？", "zh": "知道了。……是啊。\n对美也来说，鸡蛋是什么样的印象？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee072c059204930a877fe39ad71db15efb5302772d7880b52a281826f9c42cc5", "ja": "卵のイメージ……そうですね～。白くてまんまるで、\n可愛らしいです。どれも同じように見えますけど……。", "zh": "关于鸡蛋的印象……这个嘛～。白白的，圆溜溜的，\n很可爱。虽然看起来都差不多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "fc378b17eefdb888eaf3d8ca5cf37bf688506d4a4cf341224c8d26d36d1342a0", "ja": "割ってみると個性があるんです～。黄身が大きい子や\n小さい子。赤っぽい子に黄色っぽい子……むふふ。", "zh": "敲开看看，就会发现它们各有个性～有的蛋黄大，有的蛋黄小。有的颜色偏红，有的偏黄……嘻嘻。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1010_p", "source_sha256": "167432d88f4b2ff84959b585b933e06ea51022ea08b85d61146ce0f4ce57190e", "ja": "確かに。パッと見じゃわからない違いがあるな。\nさすが、美也ならではの視点だ！", "zh": "确实。光看外表是看不出这些差异的。\n不愧是美也，独到的视角！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "0e99fa645bfd7707f47a13075fd4fef6cb80c9061e96481a52126618fc109123", "ja": "それに調理の仕方で、様々な姿に変わるんです～。\n卵には、無限の可能性がありますな～。", "zh": "而且通过不同的烹饪方式，还能变成各种各样的形态呢～  \n鸡蛋可是有着无限可能的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "4427855f9a08fea8279407411cbaeb57bd48cb969ab15a29e08f09337d6c01c6", "ja": "おや～？　同じに見えるけど個性的……そして、\n無限の可能性……なんだかアイドルに似てますね～。", "zh": "哎呀～？看起来明明一样，却各有个性……还有无限的可能性……总觉得和偶像很像呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a1bd29ff12437b1fcc5703025aca06cbde093c531988996dae1a5c8846ce7536", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。アイドルもデビュー前は、\nアイドルの卵というし。意外な共通点があったな。", "zh": "哈哈，说得没错。偶像在出道前，也会被称为偶像的雏鸟嘛。没想到还有这样的共同点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "5ea0e13520665605f57566c627e147dd739e43f6ab7aee336609290d889d1f90", "ja": "あっ。決まりました～。このイースターエッグには、\n劇場のみんなのお顔を描きましょう～♪", "zh": "啊，我决定好啦～。在这个复活节彩蛋上，\n画上剧场大家的脸庞吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5e163a3e111149ba66055bef6d93a21e74c57d172a1b83f85237a8f882480767", "ja": "アイドルイースターエッグか！\nうん。きっと、みんな喜ぶと思うよ。", "zh": "偶像复活节彩蛋吗！\n嗯，我想大家一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "3d350a59362ead732fe91baf2bbab4bd040afe0fc5d86f6b8747d7189d676790", "ja": "これも{$P$}さんのおかげです～。\n卵みたいに、パカッとアイディアが生まれましたね～♪", "zh": "这也多亏了{$P$}先生哦～。像鸡蛋一样，啪地一下就冒出了点子呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0413_1017_p", "source_sha256": "663e1b2eb812b7f5c1f8dcac30787640c9dac186470a55909d9dff38b447808d", "ja": "（52個の卵のアイドルが並んだら壮観だろうな……。\n手伝うと言ったからな。完成まで美也に付き合おう！）", "zh": "（要是有52个蛋形偶像排成一列，一定很壮观吧……既然我说了要帮忙，就陪美也一起做到完成吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
